# Dusk UI — no AI slop

When editing Dusk/mobile UI:

- No hairline-divider architecture as the main look
- No identical soft grey cards / pill kits everywhere
- No marketing eyebrows or template chrome
- Cover art and type hierarchy first; chrome second
- Read and follow `.cursor/skills/no-ai-slop/SKILL.md` before large visual changes
